{"offline":"11 o'clock had struck. It was a fine, clear night, though were the only persons on the road, and they sauntered leisurely along, to avoid paying the price of fatigue for the recreation provided for the Toulidans in the valley or on the banks of their river.","offline_wer":0.085000000000000006,"stream_wer":0.106,"streamed":"11 o'clock had struck. It was a fine clear night. There were the only persons on the road. and they sauntered leisurely along to avoid paying the price of fatigue. for the recreation. provided for the Toulidans and the Valley. or on the banks of their river."}
